    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag management</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Confirm that the bike’s FASTag (if equipped) is active and carries sufficient balance. An operational FASTag eliminates toll delays on highways and keeps the transport schedule on track.</p>
