Once the assessment is complete, document any observed damages or discrepancies and provide a detailed report to the receiving party. This report should outline the findings, including photographs if possible, for transparency and record-keeping purposes.

### Odometer Verification

Before handing over the vehicle, it is essential to verify the vehicle's odometer reading against the provided Loader's Invoice (LR Bill) detailing the vehicle's mileage at pickup time. Here are the steps to follow:

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Compare Odometer Reading:</strong> Check the odometer reading displayed on the two-wheeler or motorcycle against the mileage mentioned on the LR Bill. If the readings match, proceed to the next step.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Sign Odometer Verification Form:</strong> If the readings do not match, fill out the Odometer Verification Form provided by the recipient. This form should include:

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Pickup Odometer Reading:</strong> Record the original odometer reading from the LR Bill.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Destination Odometer Reading:</strong> Record the odometer reading displayed on the vehicle.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Odometer Verification Form:</strong> Document any discrepancies between the pickup and destination odometer readings.</span></li>
</ul>
</span></li>
</ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



